    {
      "id": "2122517060995403850",
      "text": "The #Magic still must close this out. Franz with back-to-back turnovers. Lucky Pritchard missed that three. Confidence is flowing, but this team is still learning how to win big after all this time. Desmond Bane has been huge in this fourth quarter. ORL 110:103 BOS 0:40 4th",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122517060995403850",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:27:56+00:00",
      "likes": 9,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730274808808570880/oXkOl3ki_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122515306392220024",
      "text": "Both teams' offenses have come alive throughout the fourth quarter. Both teams have figured out how to attack the other's defense. Some big shots from Bane and da Silva. Going to need Franz to close this. #Magic take their use-it-or-lose-it timeout. ORL 104:99 BOS 3:16 4th",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122515306392220024",
      "published": "2026-11-17T02:20:58+00:00",
      "likes": 5,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730274808808570880/oXkOl3ki_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122508350818500683",
      "text": "Been a lot of players for the #Magic who are passing up good looks and letting the #Celtics' defense catch up. That last possession should have been a Tristan da Silva three. Passed it up and got a weird Carter floater. ORL 73:74 BOS 0:52 3rd",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122508350818500683",
      "published": "2026-11-17T01:53:19+00:00",
      "likes": 6,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730274808808570880/oXkOl3ki_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122503939480527288",
      "text": "Back-to-back threes for Jalen Suggs. 👀 Looks like seeing one go in has brought back some confidence. Didn't even hate his technical (helped Tatum missed the free throw). ORL 60:54 BOS 7:20 3rd",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122503939480527288",
      "published": "2026-11-17T01:35:48+00:00",
      "likes": 4,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
