      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122499934238769260",
      "text": "Entering today's game, 10 of Bitadze's 23 field goal attempts were alley-oops. He had 41 total alley-oop attempts last year. Carter entered today's game with 13. He had 32 total attempts last year. This is a thing.",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122499934238769260",
      "published": "2026-11-17T01:19:53+00:00",
      "likes": 11,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730274808808570880/oXkOl3ki_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Jayson Tatum made an incredible pass after George beat Suggs backdoor. Jalen Suggs came out of nowhere to block the shot after Goga Bitadze forced George to come back to his right. #Magic lead the #Celtics 50-41 at the half.",
      "quoted_author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "quoted_handle": "OMagicDaily"
