    {
      "id": "2122497271279349887",
      "text": "Jayson Tatum made an incredible pass after George beat Suggs backdoor. Jalen Suggs came out of nowhere to block the shot after Goga Bitadze forced George to come back to his right. #Magic lead the #Celtics 50-41 at the half.",
