    {
      "id": "2122496067837083859",
      "text": "I don't remember who said otherwise over the weekend... But Franz Wagner can be an All-Defensive Team-level defender too. ORL 44:38 BOS 2:00 2nd",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122496067837083859",
      "published": "2026-11-17T01:04:31+00:00",
      "likes": 15,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730274808808570880/oXkOl3ki_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122495440545268134",
      "text": "The #Magic have really done a good job leaving their centers in the dunker spot. Goga Bitadze, especially, has been great hanging out behind the defense and using the attention Franz is getting when he gets to the paint. ORL 41:38 BOS 2:44 2nd",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122495440545268134",
      "published": "2026-11-17T01:02:01+00:00",
      "likes": 0,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730274808808570880/oXkOl3ki_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122487334298128501",
      "text": "The #Magic need to find a way to get into the paint outside of Franz Wagner. Not rocket science. But it is against a team as good on D as the #Celtics. Franz has missed all the floaters he made the last three games. Still looks from the perimeter are good. ORL 12:12 BOS 3:11 1st",
      "url": "https://x.com/OMagicDaily/status/2122487334298128501",
      "published": "2026-11-17T00:29:49+00:00",
      "likes": 1,
      "author": "Orlando Magic Daily",
      "handle": "OMagicDaily",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1730274808808570880/oXkOl3ki_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
